WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.267
-Guys, St. Patrick's Day
is this Friday.

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:04.634
-Whoa!
-Yeah, and if you want to...

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:09.100
If you want to get in the
spirit, check these out here.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.734
The official "Tonight Show"
St. Patrick's Day

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:13.567
T-shirts and sweatshirts.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:14.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.067
You can get them...

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:18.734
You can only get them at
the NBC Store here at 30 Rock.

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:20.400
-Really?
-Is that true?

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.901
No. Not true.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:23.067
-Can you get them online?
-I made that up.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.334
I made that up.
You can get them...

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:25.400
Where else can you get them?
Online?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.734
-Salvation Army?

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.067
-The shop at...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:29.567
No, they're not out yet.
-Oh, okay.

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:31.567
-They're not out yet.
"The shop hat"?

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.734
[ Laughter ]
-"The show pat."

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:37.067
-The shop at...NBC...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:39.701
We could've picked a different
font, maybe, for that.

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:41.367
...NBC Studios dot com.

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:43.534
You can get it there,
but today is Tuesday.

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:46.868
St. Patrick's Day is Friday.
You gotta really FedEx it.

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:48.133
-Yeah.
-Yeah, you gotta get...

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:50.300
-Get express mail.
-Gotta hit express mail, yeah.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.634
These are
limited-edition shirts.

00:00:51.634 --> 00:00:52.701
-Limited. Yes.

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:54.234
I think we made
like five of these.

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:55.734
-Really? Just five?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:57.601
You'd better hit the button now.
-No, here's the deal.

00:00:57.601 --> 00:00:59.100
So, I didn't know how people
were gonna get these,

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.834
so I asked NBC Store, I said --
'cause the big parade is here,

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:03.367
St. Patrick's Day Parade
in New York City --

00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:05.234
"Can you open early
so that people..."

00:01:05.234 --> 00:01:08.067
'Cause every time we come in
to 30 Rock, it is jam-packed...

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:09.567
-Yeah.
-...on St. Patrick's Day.

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:11.901
And they said yes.
-Ooh!

00:01:11.901 --> 00:01:14.067
-So, they're opening up
at 9 a.m.

00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:15.901
If you know anyone
who's coming to New York City

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:18.901
for St. Patrick's Day,
9 a.m., you're safe.

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:20.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.634
-Yeah, 9 a.m. Yeah.
-9:30, watch out. Yeah.

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.734
But 9 a.m., go into the NBC...

00:01:24.734 --> 00:01:26.400
Look at these.
These are the new jam.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:30.400
And Happy St. Patrick's Day,
everybody.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.734
Appreciate it.

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:34.901
I could give out two of these.
-Give out two!

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:36.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:42.200
♪♪

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:47.501
♪♪

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:49.100
-Yes! Come on!

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.434
That's what I'm talking about!

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:52.601
We'll be right back
with Bryan Cranston, everybody!

00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:53.801
